  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于此模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Custom Credits 是一个客户端模组，允许更改结算画面（Credits）内容和终末诗（End Poem）。首次加载时，默认文件会被复制到 <em><strong>./config/customcredits/</strong></em> 文件夹中。您可以在这里添加或修改显示的内容。该模组旨在轻松追加到当前的结算画面中。虽然可以完全替换它，但我建议保留现有的结算画面，并在顶部添加您的文本。<br><br>还添加了 <em><strong>/credits show</strong></em> 命令，以便轻松查看所做的任何更改。无需重启，因为每当显示结算画面时都会读取文件。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 的自定义套件中\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"环境：客户端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showMinecraftLogoInCredits</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在结算画面顶部显示 Minecraft 标志。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将您的模组包团队添加到结算画面顶部！</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/custom-credits/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可编辑的终末诗：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/custom-credits/b.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">添加了 <em><strong>/credits show</strong></em> 命令，以便轻松调试所做的任何更改：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/custom-credits/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注和链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何模组包中使用此模组，只要下载仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在如此多的独立模组页面上跟踪评论，因此已禁用评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>对于问题、想法、建议或其他任何内容，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
